# ==============================================================================
# EMAIL DELIVERY CONFIGURATION (GMAIL SMTP / EMAILJS / WEB3FORMS)
# ==============================================================================

# Option 1: EmailJS (Free & connects directly to your Gmail inbox)
# 1. Sign up free at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add "Gmail" as your Email Service (SMTP)
# 3. Create an Email Template with variables: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}
# 4. Copy your Service ID, Template ID, and Public Key below:
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=

# Option 2: Web3Forms (Zero signup, instant free access key)
# 1. Enter your email (santhoshpalnati11@gmail.com) at https://web3forms.com/
# 2. Paste your Access Key below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
